WEBVTT

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.970
I don't want to be the one to push you away

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:13.580
I want to be the star of the show 500 times

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:02.790
Thank you.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:56.300
You have to know how to use your grey material instead of running everywhere

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.540
Great ! We have the sixth Christ's day !

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.060
I can see it!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:17.750
You can be proud of yourself. He's probably at the bottom of the lake now that he's here.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.970
Come on, you're not missing any ass, you're the guilty one.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.050
You should have stayed behind your rocker. Girls are always a nuisance.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.550
Thank you, that's the kind of reflection worthy of a voyou and a goujat.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.870
You're the one who insisted that we introduce you to the dragon,

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:29.910
so if you're not happy, you have to go back to your father.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.460
I still didn't go all this way to give up so close to the goal, you know me badly!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.920
Stop arguing, it's found!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.500
It was hidden in a night!

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:56.750
This place is a real paradise for birds.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.680
We have six of them!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:05.740
I thought we would have a lot more difficulty to put our hands on it, but in the end it's pretty easy.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.460
It's because we have mom's radar so that she doesn't see that we taught her.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:13.730
Maybe I should have worn one or two spare clothes.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.680
I have trouble believing that my dream will come true.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:23.680
Dragon, I want an amusement park for myself alone, with a lot of super giant rides.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:28.170
What do you want?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:39.470
To live in a country where there would be only cakes and sweets instead of forests and mountains.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:48.400
Take all at once!

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:52.180
Sangontaine, let go of them, they imagine that we want to steal their little ones!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.000
Attention radar!

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.220
But let go of that, Salmette, it's my turn!

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.160
The first crystal ball must be somewhere around here.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.920
As soon as we find it, we'll be able to call the dragon.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:12.720
Let's hurry!

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:21.330
It looks like crystal. Come and see, boys!

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.950
When the girl sees something shiny, she loses the ball.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.870
The crystals grow like mushrooms in this valley.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.240
I would like to eat something!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:37.800
But not so fast!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:40.720
It's weird, the inhabitants of this village look very poor.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.200
I wonder why they don't sell these crystals.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:43.930
Oh!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:06:59.580
They are...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:07.950
Please protect this village and its inhabitants, bring us wealth and prosperity!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:15.080
Oh my dear... I'm sincerely sorry, forgive me...

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.380
Stop crying, I'm not sad, come on, get up!

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:27.310
God of the mountain, save us!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.480
What's going on here?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.460
Who dares to interrupt our ritual?

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:40.900
Not me, but what is that?

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:44.910
Don't bother, my name is Videl.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.800
And I'm Goten.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:50.240
They are children, but what are they doing?

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.500
Can we know where you come from?

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.990
From the sky, Pardi.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.800
What are you talking about? Are you kidding me?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.640
Oh, little galloping!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.210
It's not worth shouting, sir, do you want a test?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:21.610
God of the mountain!

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.910
Do not pay attention to these strangers!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.790
And exalt our prayer, I beg you!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.970
The village needs food to pass the...

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:35.720
We have an interest in getting out of the way of the monster that is going down in the valley.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:38.460
What? I heard you say monster.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:50.860
Really? You're going to explain to us at the end? What's going on in this country?

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:55.320
I'll tell you that these two boys are very strong and I'm not too bad at getting out of the way. So we can help you.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.470
Five years ago, our village was prosperous. We were selling crystals.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.300
But since then, we haven't sold a single one.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.660
A curse has fallen upon Natabee!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.900
The gods are angry!

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.480
We must find a way to redeem ourselves!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.180
Before it's too late!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.400
We implore your forgiveness!

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.460
We want everything to return to how it was before, whatever the price!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:22.130
The gods of the mountain have given us blood!

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:27.510
It's been seven years since the cold and the storm have left this valley without rest!

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.230
Our culture is dead!

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:37.840
But we still managed to survive as well as possible by only hunting animals that gradually deserted the environs.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:41.540
Only a monster found a refuge in the mountain.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:45.600
From time to time, he descends on the village. He attacks the inhabitants.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.120
The situation gets worse!

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:53.160
Our sorcerer proposed to make a sacrifice to calm the wrath of the gods.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:58.060
They count on them to eliminate the monster and bring back the sun.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.340
We are desperate!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.010
The tragedy must stop! We've suffered enough like this!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.770
His superstitions are ridiculous.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.940
Making a sacrifice will be of no use.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:08.830
This guy is just a charlatan.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:11.150
Excuse me, I didn't hear you right!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.490
And you, you have nothing to ask, get out of your business!

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.330
You're furious because I broke you to pieces!

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:19.130
You're abusing these poor peasants!

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:21.520
Take back what you just said!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.880
Hey, stop it! You're making the fire of the gods go out!

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:28.610
Not at all.

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:29.290
We've already tried everything!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.780
We're going to bring back half of the men of the village in danger in the mountains

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.740
by trying to kill the monster!

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.800
It's our last hope!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:41.850
We don't have a choice, we won't survive another winter!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:45.370
What a misery!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.090
Let him do it, I'm not afraid, I want to save my village and deliver it from the monster!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.910
Don't say nonsense, we're no longer in the Middle Ages, it's madness!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.530
You have nothing to do here, get out of here!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.850
I know!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.600
No need to get angry, I'm going to climb up there and take care of the monster.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.540
I'll get rid of you on one condition,

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.320
that you give me the pretty necklace you wear around your neck.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.700
So what do you say?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:14.720
I'm starving, I want to taste one of these offerings.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.120
Please, Videl.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:16.580
No question.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.240
But we haven't eaten since we left the house.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.600
Shut up, you're going to miss everything.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.050
I'm hungry too.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:24.660
That's enough.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.740
If you want to eat, you just have to come in.

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.080
I'll manage very well on my own.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:29.960
Oh no, I want to be there when...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.180
When the monster will register you to his menu, it will be too funny!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.320
I warn you Trunks, I don't find it funny!

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:34.780
Shh!

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:36.410
Oh!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:48.530
Oh my God!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.640
The next time you'll do what I tell you!

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:23.820
Go back to your place, Songotem.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.690
You're going to end up making me notice you.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.780
I love my mom!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.090
You're gonna pay me for this!

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:21.480
What a coward...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.440
Okay, you won.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.280
But stop crying.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:32.880
Here.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:51.700
You're naive, he was pretending to cry.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.140
That's the kind of thing that always works with girls.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:55.660
Thank you.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:02.540
There he is.

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.090
Yes, it's him!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:15.010
Let's go!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.800
Good thing you're not ashamed to terrorize these poor people!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.960
I'm going to give you a butt that you won't almost forget!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.850
It's the first time I've seen such a close-up of a dinosaur!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:44.410
The poor thing is going to end up breaking his voice!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.340
I wonder if he's spitting fire!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:54.600
Don't stay there, it's dangerous! The ground is slippery, be careful not to fall!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.000
Thank you for watching this video!

00:15:11.004 --> 00:15:13.144
What if I take him home?

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.330
I'll have to cut your nails!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:39.270
Calm down, 5 minutes, I don't want to hurt you, I want to try something!

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:52.260
It's me, I think I'm dreaming!

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.120
I'm so happy to see you.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.580
Yabba is finally back to our village.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.160
Thank you all.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.620
He's right. We owe you a lot.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.940
Thank you. You are our benefactors.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.800
We didn't do anything extraordinary.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.240
Not true, Goten?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.520
You told me!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.940
By the way, sir, thank you for the necklace.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.100
I'll give it to my mother for her birthday.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.000
I can't believe it!

00:16:57.548 --> 00:16:59.548
They completely forgot what brought us here.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.560
I wonder where the seventh crystal ball is.

00:17:47.948 --> 00:17:49.948
Did you hear that noise?

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:30.820
I'm going to get you treated!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:51.840
I almost damaged my beautiful dress! Do you know how much it cost me?

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.720
We're having a good time here! You could have woken us up, Videl! We want to play too!

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:20.840
I'm a cachalot!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:25.970
What are you doing to him? I'm not a cachalot! You should put on your glasses! I'm not a cachalot!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.430
You're the one who's a cachalot!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.710
But it's starting to look good!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:30.710
Whoa!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.040
Hey, that's not normal. I'd better go and see.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:36.140
Hahaha! We're much faster than him! That's the advantage of being a child!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:36.940
Ah, you're going crazy!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:44.450
The game has just started the fight, now do it!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:47.810
He surely needs to take his breath back, after all for us he's an old man!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.620
I didn't know there were guys like him on this planet.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.500
It's weird that no one met him.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:56.240
It's not going as I planned. I'm leaving.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:57.640
Follow me!

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:09.420
Do you want to be an idiot?

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:11.970
Take a look at his feet.

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:14.080
Go on, look right behind him, you see?

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:16.850
That might be the solution to our problem.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:18.460
Oh...

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:20.410
Wow...

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:27.140
Son Goten, I found the seventh crystal ball.

00:22:27.140 --> 00:22:28.380
Thanks to it, we'll be able to...

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:29.920
Call our friend the dragon and...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.080
I asked him to get rid of that dirty guy who keeps bothering us.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:39.920
Listen, I'm going to try to distract his attention.

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:40.780
And you, you...

00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:41.020
I understand!

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:48.470
You, you have nothing else more interesting to do than to make fun of others?

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:52.400
You're not going to make me believe that you're a real warrior!

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:54.000
Bwa bwa bwa bwa bwa bwa bwa bwa!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.910
You little...

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.000
You

00:24:15.500 --> 00:24:17.900
Brutal Rose doesn't know what to do, I'll show her

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:10.740
No need to hide, crystal ball, I'll find you!

00:25:11.140 --> 00:25:29.910
Quick, I need you, he's way too...

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:41.560
It's not that way, it's not that way either, it's that way, oh!

00:26:09.240 --> 00:26:11.900
The fight is unequal. The way they fight is unworthy.

00:26:37.130 --> 00:26:41.520
Luckily, dad isn't here because he always told me that we have to overcome his fear.

00:26:46.480 --> 00:26:55.540
It's not funny, I would like to see you instead.

00:27:03.320 --> 00:27:04.190
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:27:34.120 --> 00:27:37.730
Damn you big muscles! We'll see your head when you see the dragon!

00:27:37.930 --> 00:27:40.700
What are you waiting for? Go ahead, call him! Do you know how it works?

00:27:40.980 --> 00:27:42.330
Yeah, of course!

00:27:42.550 --> 00:27:44.910
You're going to apologize to me, otherwise our friend is going to get angry!

00:28:01.400 --> 00:28:01.840
Are you m...

00:28:11.600 --> 00:28:12.120
Someone's there!

00:28:12.580 --> 00:28:15.210
They might be broken by the earthquake.

00:28:15.790 --> 00:28:16.750
I don't hear a thing!

00:28:17.090 --> 00:28:18.350
So... So... So... So...

00:28:18.350 --> 00:28:19.530
Kogouten, hurry up!

00:28:24.540 --> 00:28:28.390
Tramiel, he didn't do that to me!

00:28:33.000 --> 00:28:34.480
Morgothen, help, come quickly!

00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:36.150
What can I be afraid of?

00:28:36.210 --> 00:28:38.710
Maybe he didn't come because the cave is too small?

00:28:39.400 --> 00:28:40.740
But yes, of course, I'll try again!

00:28:43.660 --> 00:28:48.460
I can't believe you're abandoning me!

00:29:00.540 --> 00:29:27.500
If it pee-pee down my culottos

00:30:04.030 --> 00:30:05.430
Well done for you.

00:30:52.040 --> 00:30:59.620
Avenged, paid, it was finally found because...

00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:00.570
SHUT UP!

00:31:00.690 --> 00:31:16.240
Oli, he survived!

00:31:16.720 --> 00:31:25.820
So you're his Gohan?

00:31:25.920 --> 00:31:29.240
AHH! I SAVED HIM!

00:31:31.660 --> 00:31:32.820
I'm so happy to see you!

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:34.020
Hi little brother!

00:31:37.240 --> 00:31:40.260
You're lucky you're still alive. Broly is really strong.

00:31:40.880 --> 00:31:41.720
Who's Broly?

00:31:41.980 --> 00:31:47.840
Do you know this brute? Isn't he one of your friends?

00:31:48.060 --> 00:31:51.680
He comes from the same planet as my father. They were even raised together.

00:31:51.940 --> 00:31:53.900
My father beat him in a one-on-one fight seven years ago.

00:31:53.940 --> 00:31:58.260
Now I understand why he took Videl and us. He must have confused your brother with Son Goku.

00:31:58.660 --> 00:31:59.000
What?

00:32:00.600 --> 00:32:01.920
But... Vidal is with you?

00:32:02.760 --> 00:32:03.180
Vidal!

00:32:05.400 --> 00:32:09.780
I just saw it. It's my father you're looking for.

00:32:10.420 --> 00:32:13.340
Sorry, you're coming too late. He's no longer part of this world.

00:32:13.480 --> 00:32:14.340
But I can pay him back!

00:32:31.180 --> 00:32:32.140
It's not going to be easy.

00:32:33.020 --> 00:32:37.940
Don't trust appearances.

00:32:38.380 --> 00:32:41.210
He's a monster, but I know how to defend myself.

00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:55.440
Bye, cachalot.

00:33:02.970 --> 00:33:04.510
Oh, how are you doing, Videl?

00:33:37.220 --> 00:33:38.620
Uh...

00:33:45.710 --> 00:33:57.310
I believe.

00:34:30.600 --> 00:34:32.040
He is much stronger than us.

00:35:19.710 --> 00:35:25.250
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:35:27.280 --> 00:35:27.600
Ah.

00:35:28.480 --> 00:35:28.820
Ah.

00:36:04.828 --> 00:36:05.328
Watch out!

00:36:35.500 --> 00:36:47.140
I have an interest to react quickly.

00:36:47.280 --> 00:36:50.140
The lava, here is the solution!

00:37:32.560 --> 00:37:33.340
He fell into the trap.

00:38:19.230 --> 00:38:20.270
Hello, little heart.

00:38:45.160 --> 00:38:46.240
My little heart, is that you?

00:38:47.360 --> 00:38:52.540
Oh, come on!

00:38:53.490 --> 00:38:54.530
Krillin, not possible!

00:38:55.090 --> 00:38:58.760
Don't you think I look proud with this sublime costume?

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:00.380
Ha ha!

00:39:01.480 --> 00:39:04.740
I came to wait. You almost got very hot.

00:39:04.880 --> 00:39:08.200
I don't know how to thank you. Without your help, I would never have had the strength to hide.

00:39:08.640 --> 00:39:11.580
If you hadn't come, I would surely have had the same fate as Broly.

00:39:11.820 --> 00:39:14.790
Usually, it's you who comes to get me out of the gutter. It changes.

00:39:15.250 --> 00:39:18.970
I can't understand what made Broly cross almost the entire universe.

00:39:19.210 --> 00:39:20.330
It's rather rare to be disillusioned at this point.

00:39:21.620 --> 00:39:23.940
He shouldn't have digested his defeat against Sangoku.

00:39:24.280 --> 00:39:25.140
Yeah, surely.

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:32.040
Oh! Oh!

00:39:32.220 --> 00:39:32.540
Huh?

00:39:38.070 --> 00:39:39.570
But... No, it's not possible!

00:39:48.950 --> 00:39:50.350
I'm in Sangohan, I think I'm dreaming!

00:39:50.570 --> 00:39:53.310
No living being can survive such heat, he must have something!

00:39:53.810 --> 00:39:56.530
Oh, why didn't I stay quietly at home in front of the TV?

00:39:57.070 --> 00:39:58.430
Oh la la...

00:39:59.220 --> 00:39:59.980
No, he's not f-

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:02.740
Shang-Gohan, come on, let's get this over with, I'm in a hurry!

00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:05.400
Who's there?

00:40:06.930 --> 00:40:08.950
This could be a lot better, why?

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:30.240
Thank you.

00:41:32.620 --> 00:41:32.780
Thank you.

00:42:01.180 --> 00:42:13.110
Oh, my dear, I know how to get you out of there, I have a plan.

00:42:13.270 --> 00:42:25.220
Elle, did you hurt yourself?

00:42:25.560 --> 00:42:25.600
Ah!

00:42:25.740 --> 00:42:25.980
Ah!

00:42:26.420 --> 00:42:26.760
Bitch!

00:42:31.330 --> 00:42:37.190
You make me waste my time, it's not up to you that I want it!

00:43:08.260 --> 00:43:09.760
Try it, Gunma.

00:43:11.220 --> 00:43:11.780
Yes.

00:43:36.460 --> 00:43:38.220
Oh, I'm... Oh, yes, I remember.

00:43:42.930 --> 00:43:49.190
We can't hold on. We need more power.

00:43:50.250 --> 00:43:53.800
Raccoon, please, help us. We'll never make it without you.

00:44:00.670 --> 00:44:02.630
Courage, boys! You are my sons!

00:44:02.970 --> 00:44:03.230
Dad!

00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:07.060
I know this voice!

00:44:07.260 --> 00:44:08.980
Draw the energy deep inside you!

00:44:09.400 --> 00:44:10.800
Don't worry about the rest!

00:44:11.060 --> 00:44:12.250
I'm in charge!

00:44:12.830 --> 00:44:25.210
Did you go get dad?

00:44:30.600 --> 00:44:31.980
Here you are finally, kashalo!

00:44:32.930 --> 00:44:33.410
KAAAAAAME!

00:44:33.680 --> 00:44:48.440
Son Gohan, you don't give me the maximum, focus!

00:44:50.880 --> 00:44:53.040
Don't be afraid Son Goten!

00:44:53.140 --> 00:44:58.090
You're not going to let him destroy this planet!

00:45:00.060 --> 00:45:03.300
You can count on you. I won't be there all the time to protect his defense.

00:45:03.760 --> 00:45:22.670
It's getting pretty bad. We're really out of shape.

00:45:32.490 --> 00:45:34.740
It's a nightmare. I must wake up.

00:45:42.110 --> 00:45:55.810
Let's go!

00:46:04.960 --> 00:46:05.880
You're not pressuring me!

00:46:07.140 --> 00:46:21.440
Don't you feel ashamed?

00:46:56.520 --> 00:46:56.700
Daddy

00:47:09.980 --> 00:47:12.350
Dad! You came here on purpose for us, didn't you?

00:47:24.230 --> 00:47:26.330
Don't tell me! You came here to settle his account, didn't you?

00:47:26.510 --> 00:47:28.290
Uh, no, not exactly. I wasn't alone.

00:47:28.810 --> 00:47:29.790
Don't be so modest.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:31.060
and tell me the whole story.

00:47:31.320 --> 00:47:32.080
But I...

00:47:32.080 --> 00:47:34.800
And don't try to make me think you're not there for anything, I want the truth!

00:47:38.040 --> 00:47:39.560
Come back here right now!

00:47:41.560 --> 00:47:42.280
Son Tongoan!

00:47:42.280 --> 00:47:45.010
I know very well who you are!

00:47:45.110 --> 00:47:47.310
It's useless to hide the truth from me!

00:47:49.520 --> 00:47:50.780
Isn't that funny, Namu?

00:47:51.430 --> 00:47:54.670
Don't worry, they don't look like that, but they love to pamper each other.

00:47:54.770 --> 00:47:56.280
It's part of the game.

00:47:56.460 --> 00:47:57.260
I'm hungry, aren't you?

00:47:57.440 --> 00:47:59.020
Let's go for a little walk in the village.

00:48:05.170 --> 00:48:07.270
Sangoku is back on Earth.

00:48:07.900 --> 00:48:09.580
You're probably wondering how that's possible.

00:48:09.860 --> 00:48:12.130
Maybe it's because of the crystal balls?

00:48:12.530 --> 00:48:14.590
Or maybe you were dreaming? Who knows?

00:48:15.140 --> 00:48:16.480
No one knows the truth.

00:48:16.660 --> 00:48:20.440
I don't remember anything anymore.

00:48:20.960 --> 00:48:22.920
Could you tell me how I ended up here?

00:48:44.620 --> 00:48:45.120
Kingdom

00:49:00.730 --> 00:49:04.860
Thank you for watching!

00:49:30.190 --> 00:49:31.440
I'm going to die
